# The cases of faults_trace_copy.anti: a name and the value of ANTI_FAULT,
# see tests/CMakeLists.txt. alloc counts the memory of the runtime after
# the start. In dev mode the thirteenth is the readable name of the first
# frame, which symbolize makes from the name of its symbol. With -g the
# frame reads its line from the object of the program, whose path takes
# the sixteenth and whose bytes take the seventeenth and the first open.
name_memory alloc:13:ENOMEM dev
name_memory_g alloc:13:ENOMEM dev g
object_path_memory alloc:16:ENOMEM dev g
object_memory alloc:17:ENOMEM dev g
object_refused open:1:EACCES dev g
